    "text": "During an adiabatic process, the pressure of a gas is found to be proportional to the cube of its absolute temperature. The value of ratio&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></msub></mfrac></math>&nbsp; for the gas is"
  },
