  "correct_answer": "1.5",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>In an adiabatic process, <math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext> <mi>&#947;</mi> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>constant</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <msup> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">P</mtext> <mrow> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> </mrow> </math><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math>&#160; <mrow> <msup> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext> <mrow> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mo>/</mo> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>constant</mtext> </mrow></mfenced><mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;P</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br />Given&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <msup> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">T</mtext> <mn>3</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo> <mfenced close=\")\" open=\"(\" separators=\",\"> <mrow> <mtext>constant</mtext> </mrow> </mfenced> <mtext mathvariant=\"italic\">&#160;P</mtext> </mrow> </math><br /><br /><math> <mrow> <mo>&#8756;</mo> </mrow> </math>&nbsp;&nbsp;<math> <mrow> <mfrac> <mrow> <mi>&#947;</mi> </mrow> <mrow> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>1</mn> </mrow> </mfrac> <mo>=</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mo>-</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mo>=</mo> <mi>&#947;</mi> </mrow> </math><br /><br />or&nbsp;&nbsp;<math>&#160; <mrow> <mn>2</mn> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mo>&#8658;</mo> <mi>&#947;</mi> <mo>=</mo> <mn>3</mn> <mo>/</mo> <mn>2</mn></mrow></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi></msub><msub><mi>C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">v</mi></msub></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>5</mn></math></p>"
